      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "I\u2019m Bartolina Quispe, and we live near Bolivia\u2019s big lithium
    reserve. A mining company promises our village schools and clean-energy jobs
    if we let them mine here. But their operations would drain and poison the springs
    we use for drinking and irrigation. Should I accept their \u2018green\u2019 future,
    even if it sacrifices our water security?"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 35369db3e85c9f4108fd3a921eefabf7, type: 2}
